  '分辨率越高细节越清晰、边缘更稳定。\x0a同时显存占用与生成耗时会明显增加。': 'Higher\x20resolution\x20gives\x20clearer\x20details\x20and\x20steadier\x20edges.\x0aIt\x20also\x20uses\x20more\x20VRAM\x20and\x20takes\x20longer.',
  '帧率越高运动更顺滑、动作更连贯。\x0a但生成更慢、成本更高。\x0a常用\x2024\x20帧；想更快或更省可选\x2016\x20帧。': 'Higher\x20frame\x20rate\x20makes\x20motion\x20smoother\x20and\x20more\x20continuous.\x0aGeneration\x20is\x20slower\x20and\x20costs\x20more.\x0a24\x20fps\x20is\x20common;\x20choose\x2016\x20fps\x20for\x20faster\x20or\x20cheaper\x20runs.',
  '官方范围\x201-60\x20fps；24\x20fps\x20较稳妥，30\x20fps\x20更顺滑。提高帧率会在相同时长下生成更多帧，成本和耗时会增加。': "Official range is 1-60 fps. 24 fps is reliable, while 30 fps is smoother. Higher frame rates generate more frames for the same duration, increasing cost and processing time.",
  '帧数决定生成片段的长度：数值越大视频越长、耗时越高。\x0a填\x200\x20表示按源视频全长处理（适合整段替换）。': "Frame count controls clip length: higher values make longer videos and take more time.\nUse 0 to process the full source video, which is useful for full-segment replacement.",
  '秒数决定生成视频的时长：数值越大视频越长、耗时与成本越高。': "Seconds control the video duration: higher values make longer videos and increase time and cost.",
  '1080p\x20图生视频，适合首帧单图驱动': '1080p\x20image-to-video,\x20ideal\x20for\x20single\x20first-frame\x20input',
  '1600\x20及以上分辨率需要使用\x2048G\x20显存执行。': "Resolutions of 1600 or above require 48 GB VRAM.",
  '16帧': "16 fps",
  '24帧': "24 fps",
  '30帧': "30 fps",
