  '阿里最强开源模型Qwen2.5': 'Alibaba\x27s\x20strongest\x20open-source\x20Qwen2.5\x20model',
  '被替换图': "Image to replace",
  '标准\x20/\x20Fast；使用示例：[推进]一只猫咪在花园中奔跑，镜头缓缓推进特写': "Standard/Fast. Example: [Push in] A cat runs through a garden as the camera slowly pushes in for a close-up",
  '补帧视频': "Frame-interpolated video",
