  '补帧视频\x20(已取消)': "Frame-interpolated video (cancelled)",
  '不接素材时描述文生视频；接首帧/尾帧时可用\x20@图片1\x20/\x20@图片2\x20指代。例如：让\x20@图片1\x20中的人物向镜头挥手，随后过渡到\x20@图片2\x20的街景。': "Describe text-to-video when no assets are connected. With first/last frames, refer to them as @Image1 / @Image2. Example: have the person in @Image1 wave at the camera, then transition to the street scene in @Image2.",
  '不接素材时描述文生视频；接首帧/尾帧时描述\x20@图片1\x20到\x20@图片2\x20的变化。例如：@图片1\x20中的猫咪缓缓向前走，最后过渡到\x20@图片2\x20的画面，电影质感。': 'Describe\x20text-to-video\x20when\x20no\x20assets\x20are\x20connected.\x20With\x20first/last\x20frames,\x20describe\x20the\x20change\x20from\x20@Image1\x20to\x20@Image2.\x20Example:\x20the\x20cat\x20in\x20@Image1\x20slowly\x20walks\x20forward\x20and\x20transitions\x20into\x20the\x20scene\x20in\x20@Image2,\x20cinematic.',
  '不接素材时描述文生视频；接首帧/尾帧时描述动作、运镜和过渡。例如：人物缓缓站起身，向镜头走来；或镜头从海边缓慢移向山顶。': "Describe text-to-video when no assets are connected. With first/last frames, describe the action, camera movement, and transition. Example: the person slowly stands and walks toward the camera, or the camera moves from the beach to the mountaintop.",
  '不接素材时描述文生视频；接首帧或首尾帧时描述动作、运镜和过渡。4K\x20图生当前只使用首帧。': "Describe text-to-video when no assets are connected. With a first frame or first/last frames, describe the action, camera movement, and transition. 4K image-to-video currently uses only the first frame.",
  '不接图时描述文生视频；接\x20@图片1\x20是首帧，接\x20@图片1\x20+\x20@图片2\x20是首尾帧。例如：@图片1\x20中的人物缓缓转身微笑，最后过渡到\x20@图片2\x20的构图。': "Describe text-to-video when no image is connected. @Image1 is the first frame; @Image1 + @Image2 are first/last frames. Example: the person in @Image1 slowly turns and smiles, finally transitioning to the composition in @Image2.",
  '不选': "None",
  '参考视频（仅仅ads2v才需要）': "Reference video (only needed for ads2v)",
