  '用\x20@图片1、@视频1\x20指代参考素材。例如：参考\x20@图片1\x20的角色外观和\x20@视频1\x20的镜头风格，生成夜晚街道行走视频。': 'Use\x20@Image1\x20and\x20@Video1\x20to\x20reference\x20assets.\x20Example:\x20use\x20the\x20character\x20appearance\x20from\x20@Image1\x20and\x20the\x20camera\x20style\x20from\x20@Video1\x20to\x20generate\x20a\x20walking\x20video\x20on\x20a\x20night\x20street.',
  '用\x20@图片1、@图片2、@视频1\x20指代参考素材。例如：@图片1\x20中的人物来到\x20@图片2\x20的场景中，学习\x20@图片3\x20的动作，保持角色一致。': "Use @Image1, @Image2, and @Video1 to reference assets. Example: the person from @Image1 enters the scene in @Image2, follows the motion from @Image3, and keeps character consistency.",
  '用于告诉工作流第一张参考图的角色：原图用于常规编辑，姿势图用于姿态约束，深度图用于空间结构约束。': "Tells the workflow what role the first reference image has: original image for normal editing, pose map for pose constraints, depth map for spatial structure constraints.",
  '用于告诉工作流需要检测/识别的主体人数。识别人数不准时再调整。': "Tells the workflow how many subjects to detect/recognize. Adjust only when the detected count is inaccurate.",
  '用于微调遮罩边缘。正数：向外扩，覆盖更多边缘细节；负数：向内收，减少误伤背景。可拖动或输入，支持负数。': "Fine-tunes mask edges. Positive values expand outward to cover more edge detail; negative values contract inward to reduce background spill. Drag or type values; negative values are supported.",
  '用于指定检测识别目标。默认是\x20person，如无特殊要求请别进行修改。': 'Specifies\x20the\x20detection\x20target.\x20Default\x20is\x20person;\x20do\x20not\x20change\x20unless\x20needed.',
  '有风格参考图时生效。控制参考图的色彩、材质、光影和整体氛围影响；值越高越贴近参考风格。': 'Applies\x20when\x20a\x20style\x20reference\x20image\x20is\x20present.\x20Controls\x20how\x20much\x20the\x20reference\x20affects\x20color,\x20material,\x20lighting,\x20and\x20overall\x20mood;\x20higher\x20values\x20stay\x20closer\x20to\x20the\x20reference\x20style.',
  '有角色参考图时生效。控制参考角色的脸、发型、服装等细节保留程度；100\x20尽量保留完整角色，0\x20更偏向只保留脸部特征。': 'Applies\x20when\x20a\x20character\x20reference\x20image\x20is\x20present.\x20Controls\x20how\x20much\x20face,\x20hairstyle,\x20clothing,\x20and\x20other\x20details\x20are\x20preserved;\x20100\x20preserves\x20the\x20full\x20character\x20as\x20much\x20as\x20possible,\x20while\x200\x20keeps\x20mainly\x20facial\x20features.',
  '有主输入图时生效。控制主图对内容、构图和颜色的影响；值越高越参考原图，值越低文字提示越主导。': "Applies when a main input image is present. Controls how much the main image affects content, composition, and color; higher values follow the image more, lower values let the text prompt lead.",
