  '选择朗读的人声角色。不同音色适合不同场景：睿智女性适合知识讲解，低沉男声适合有声书旁白，元气少女/活泼女孩适合娱乐内容，可爱女孩适合儿童内容。': "Choose the speaking voice. Different voices suit different scenarios: Wise Woman for knowledge narration, Deep Male Voice for audiobook narration, Inspirational Girl / Lively Girl for entertainment, and Lovely Girl for children's content.",
  '控制朗读速度，默认1.0倍速。0.5为慢速（适合教学、冥想内容），2.0为快速（适合资讯速读）。有声书建议0.9-1.1，广告配音建议1.1-1.3。': "Control speech speed. Default is 1.0x. 0.5 is slow, useful for teaching or meditation; 2.0 is fast, useful for quick news reading. Audiobooks usually work well at 0.9-1.1, ads at 1.1-1.3.",
  '控制输出音量大小，默认1.0为标准音量。增大音量适合嘈杂环境播放，减小音量适合作为背景音使用。': "Control output volume. Default 1.0 is standard volume. Increase it for noisy playback environments, or decrease it for background audio.",
  '调整音调高低，单位为半音。默认0为原调。正值使声音更高亢明亮（+3适合活泼角色），负值使声音更低沉厚重（-3适合成熟角色）。范围-12到+12（一个八度）。': "Adjust pitch in semitones. Default 0 keeps the original pitch. Positive values make the voice brighter and higher, while negative values make it deeper and heavier. Range: -12 to +12, one octave.",
  '选择朗读时的情感色彩。开心适合欢快内容，悲伤适合悼词/抒情散文，愤怒适合慷慨陈词，恐惧适合悬疑/恐怖故事，惊讶适合新闻播报，中性适合说明文/知识讲解。': "Choose the emotional tone for reading. Happy suits cheerful content, Sad suits eulogies or lyrical prose, Angry suits emphatic speeches, Fearful suits suspense or horror, Surprised suits news-style delivery, and Neutral suits explanations or educational narration.",
  'MiniMax\x20语音合成\x20V2.8\x20(录音室级)\x20用法\x0a输入[[red:要合成的文本]]，AI\x20生成自然语音\x0a支持多种音色，录音室级音质\x0a[[red:提示词占位举例]]：\x0a\x20\x20•\x20大家好，欢迎来到今天的节目，我是你们的主播小AI。\x0a\x20\x20•\x20今天天气真好，适合出去走走，感受阳光和微风。\x0a\x20\x20•\x20请注意，列车即将到站，请做好下车准备。\x0a可在高级设置中选择音色、语速、音量、音高、情感': "MiniMax speech synthesis V2.8 (Studio) usage\nEnter [[red:the text to synthesize]] and AI generates natural speech.\nSupports multiple voices with studio-grade audio quality.\n[[red:Prompt placeholder examples]]:\n  - Hello everyone, welcome to today's show. I am your AI host.\n  - The weather is lovely today, perfect for a walk in the sun and breeze.\n  - Attention please, the train is arriving. Please prepare to get off.\nAdvanced settings can choose voice, speed, volume, pitch, and emotion.",
  'MiniMax\x20语音合成\x20V2.8\x20(广播级极速)\x20用法\x0a输入[[red:要合成的文本]]，AI\x20生成自然语音\x0a支持多种音色，广播级极速音质\x0a[[red:提示词占位举例]]：\x0a\x20\x20•\x20大家好，欢迎来到今天的节目，我是你们的主播小AI。\x0a\x20\x20•\x20今天天气真好，适合出去走走，感受阳光和微风。\x0a\x20\x20•\x20请注意，列车即将到站，请做好下车准备。\x0a可在高级设置中选择音色、语速、音量、音高、情感': "MiniMax speech synthesis V2.8 (Turbo) usage\nEnter [[red:the text to synthesize]] and AI generates natural speech.\nSupports multiple voices with broadcast-grade fast audio quality.\n[[red:Prompt placeholder examples]]:\n  - Hello everyone, welcome to today's show. I am your AI host.\n  - The weather is lovely today, perfect for a walk in the sun and breeze.\n  - Attention please, the train is arriving. Please prepare to get off.\nAdvanced settings can choose voice, speed, volume, pitch, and emotion.",
  'MiniMax\x20Music\x202.6\x20纯音乐': "MiniMax Music 2.6 Instrumental",
  'MiniMax\x20Music\x202.6\x20文生音乐': 'MiniMax\x20Music\x202.6\x20Text\x20to\x20Music',
