  '码率': 'Bitrate',
  '格式': "Format",
  '描述音乐风格、情绪、场景，例：流行音乐，伤感，适合雨夜': "Describe music style, emotion, and scene, e.g. pop music, sad, suitable for a rainy night",
  '描述你想要的音乐风格、情绪和场景。例如「流行,民谣,女声,温暖治愈」「电子,舞曲,夜店,节奏感强」「古风,古筝,山水意境」。填\x22-\x22时会使用歌词内容作为基础描述。': "Describe the music style, emotion, and scene you want, such as \"pop, folk, female vocal, warm and healing\", \"electronic, dance, club, strong rhythm\", or \"Chinese style, guzheng, flute, landscape mood\". Enter \"-\" to use the lyrics as the base description.",
  '开启后AI会根据风格描述自动优化你输入的歌词，让歌词与旋律更匹配。适合歌词较粗糙、需要AI润色的场景。': "When enabled, AI optimizes your lyrics based on the style description so they better fit the melody. Useful when lyrics are rough and need AI polishing.",
  'MiniMax\x20Music\x202.6\x20纯音乐生成用法\x0a输入[[red:纯音乐描述]]，AI\x20生成无人声的器乐音乐\x0a适合视频配乐、游戏BGM、播客背景音乐、氛围音乐等场景\x0a[[red:提示词占位举例]]：\x0a\x20\x20•\x20爵士小酒馆，钢琴三重奏，慵懒氛围，低频贝斯饱满，夜间松弛感\x0a\x20\x20•\x20中国古风，古筝+笛子+琵琶，山水意境，宁静悠远\x0a\x20\x20•\x20电子\x20ambient，太空感，合成器铺底，冥想放松\x0a\x20\x20•\x20轻快的ukulele，阳光海滩，度假风格，无忧无虑': "MiniMax Music 2.6 instrumental usage\nEnter an [[red:instrumental music description]] and AI generates non-vocal instrumental music.\nUseful for video scoring, game BGM, podcast background music, and ambient music.\n[[red:Prompt placeholder examples]]:\n  - Jazz bistro, piano trio, lazy atmosphere, rich low-end bass, relaxed night feeling\n  - Chinese style, guzheng + flute + pipa, landscape mood, quiet and distant\n  - Electronic ambient, space feeling, synth bed, meditation and relaxation\n  - Light ukulele, sunny beach, vacation style, carefree",
  'MiniMax\x20Music\x202.6\x20文生音乐用法\x0a输入[[red:歌词]]，AI\x20根据歌词创作完整歌曲（含旋律+人声）\x0a在高级设置中可填写风格场景描述，引导音乐风格走向\x0a[[red:歌词格式说明]]：\x0a\x20\x20支持结构标签控制歌曲段落：\x0a\x20\x20[Intro]\x20前奏\x20\x20[Verse]\x20主歌\x20\x20[Pre-Chorus]\x20预副歌\x0a\x20\x20[Chorus]\x20副歌\x20\x20[Bridge]\x20桥段\x20\x20[Outro]\x20尾奏\x0a[[red:提示词占位举例]]：\x0a\x20\x20[Verse]\x20阳光下的操场\x20我们奔跑着笑\x0a\x20\x20[Chorus]\x20这是我们的夏天\x20永远不落幕\x0a\x20\x20[Verse\x202]\x20晚风轻轻吹过\x20带着青草味道\x0a\x20\x20[Chorus]\x20这是我们的夏天\x20永远不落幕': 'MiniMax\x20Music\x202.6\x20text-to-music\x20usage\x0aEnter\x20[[red:lyrics]]\x20and\x20AI\x20creates\x20a\x20full\x20song\x20from\x20them,\x20including\x20melody\x20and\x20vocals.\x0aAdvanced\x20settings\x20can\x20set\x20a\x20style\x20and\x20scene\x20description\x20to\x20guide\x20the\x20musical\x20direction.\x0a[[red:Lyrics\x20format\x20notes]]:\x0a\x20\x20Structure\x20tags\x20can\x20control\x20song\x20sections:\x0a\x20\x20[Intro]\x20intro\x20\x20[Verse]\x20verse\x20\x20[Pre-Chorus]\x20pre-chorus\x0a\x20\x20[Chorus]\x20chorus\x20\x20[Bridge]\x20bridge\x20\x20[Outro]\x20outro\x0a[[red:Prompt\x20placeholder\x20examples]]:\x0a\x20\x20[Verse]\x20On\x20the\x20sunlit\x20playground,\x20we\x20run\x20and\x20laugh\x0a\x20\x20[Chorus]\x20This\x20is\x20our\x20summer,\x20it\x20never\x20fades\x0a\x20\x20[Verse\x202]\x20Evening\x20breeze\x20passes\x20gently,\x20carrying\x20the\x20smell\x20of\x20grass\x0a\x20\x20[Chorus]\x20This\x20is\x20our\x20summer,\x20it\x20never\x20fades',
  'doubao-seed-tts-2.0': "Doubao Seed TTS 2.0",
