  '豆包语音合成，可使用预设音色、官方\x20_uranus/_mars\x20音色或火山自定义/音色设计音色': "Doubao speech synthesis with preset voices, official _uranus/_mars voices, or Volcengine custom / voice-design voices",
  '填写后覆盖预设音色，默认音色将不可选。_uranus_bigtts\x20走\x20TTS\x202.0，_mars_bigtts\x20走\x20TTS\x201.0，其它火山自定义/音色设计音色\x20ID\x20走\x20ICL\x202.0。': 'Overrides\x20the\x20preset\x20voice\x20when\x20filled;\x20the\x20default\x20voice\x20becomes\x20unavailable.\x20_uranus_bigtts\x20uses\x20TTS\x202.0,\x20_mars_bigtts\x20uses\x20TTS\x201.0,\x20and\x20other\x20Volcengine\x20custom\x20/\x20voice-design\x20IDs\x20use\x20ICL\x202.0.',
  'doubao-seed-tts-2.0（豆包语音合成，自动适配官方/自定义音色）用法：\x0a\x20\x201.\x20输入要朗读的文本内容\x0a\x20\x202.\x20在按钮旁选择目标音色（灿灿/云舟/清新女声/高冷御姐）\x0a\x20\x203.\x20高级设置可调节语速、音量、音调、格式、采样率、自定义音色ID\x0a\x20\x204.\x20点击生成按钮\x0a\x0a语速/音量：0=正常，正数加速/加音，负数减速/减音\x0a自定义音色：_uranus_bigtts\x20走\x20TTS\x202.0；_mars_bigtts\x20走\x20TTS\x201.0；控制台自定义/音色设计音色ID走\x20ICL\x202.0\x0a完整音色列表：https://www.volcengine.com/docs/6561/1257544': "Doubao Seed TTS 2.0 usage:\n  1. Enter the text to read\n  2. Choose the target voice next to the button (Cancang / Yunzhou / Fresh female voice / Cool mature female)\n  3. Advanced settings can adjust speed, volume, tone, format, sample rate, and custom voice ID\n  4. Click generate\n\nSpeed / volume: 0 = normal, positive values increase speed/volume, negative values decrease speed/volume.\nCustom voices: _uranus_bigtts uses TTS 2.0; _mars_bigtts uses TTS 1.0; console custom / voice-design IDs use ICL 2.0.\nFull voice list: https://www.volcengine.com/docs/6561/1257544",
  '参考音频1': 'Reference\x20audio\x201',
  '参考音频2': "Reference audio 2",
  '参考音频3': "Reference audio 3",
  '常规快速模式，速度和成本平衡。': 'Regular\x20fast\x20mode,\x20balancing\x20speed\x20and\x20cost.',
