  'doubao-seed-audio-1.0，可用文本和参考音频生成/克隆语音': 'Doubao\x20Seed\x20Audio\x201.0;\x20generate\x20or\x20clone\x20speech\x20from\x20text\x20and\x20reference\x20audio',
  '兼容\x20V6\x20系参数和老项目风格，适合复现旧版效果。': "Compatible with V6-series parameters and older project styles, useful for recreating legacy results.",
