  '输入画面描述': "Describe the image",
  'KREA2\x20文生图工作流，支持尺寸比例与提示词强化': 'KREA2\x20text-to-image\x20workflow\x20with\x20aspect\x20ratio\x20and\x20prompt\x20enhancement\x20controls',
  'KREA2文生图': "KREA2 Text to Image",
  'OpenAI\x20图像生成': "OpenAI Image Generation",
